  "decided_list": true,
  "overstatement": "not_asked",
  "summary": "The plan turns Mina’s job-card routine into a six-chapter portfolio, with rearranging evidence cards and careful attribution of her work. Its greatest weakness is that the narrative captions and closing answer remain specified by intent rather than written, leaving the actual storytelling unproven."
